<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-HK">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+HK:wght@400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Noto Sans HK', sans-serif; margin: 0; background: #f6f8fb; color: #0f172a; }
    .container { max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; }
    header { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
    h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0; }
    .card { background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(2,6,23,0.1); margin-top: 24px; }
    label { display: block; font-weight: 600; margin: 8px 0 6px; }
    input, select { width: 100%; padding: 10px 12px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 10px; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .actions { text-align: right; margin-top: 16px; }
    button { background: #2563eb; color: white; border: none; padding: 10px 16px; border-radius: 10px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; }
    .error { color: #b91c1c; margin-top: 8px; }
    footer { margin-top: 32px; color: #475569; font-size: 13px; text-align: center; }
  </style>
  <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined') { %>
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <% } %>
  <script>
    function ensureMinDate() {
      const input = document.getElementById('startDate');
      const today = new Date();
      const iso = new Date(today.getTime() + 24*3600*1000).toISOString().slice(0,10);
      input.min = iso;
    }
    window.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', ensureMinDate);
  </script>
  </head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <header>
      <h1>旅遊易 TravelEase</h1>
    </header>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>建立你的旅遊計劃</h2>
      <% if (typeof error !== 'undefined') { %>
        <p class="error"><%= error %></p>
      <% } %>
      <form method="POST" action="/trips">
        <label for="name">姓名</label>
        <input id="name" name="name" placeholder="王小明" required />

        <label for="email">電郵</label>
        <input id="email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required />

        <div class="grid">
          <div>
            <label for="destination">國家/地區</label>
            <select id="destination" name="destination" required>
              <option value="">請選擇</option>
              <option value="日本" selected>日本</option>
              <option value="韓國">韓國</option>
              <option value="台灣">台灣</option>
              <option value="泰國">泰國</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="city">城市</label>
            <input id="city" name="city" placeholder="東京" required />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid">
          <div>
            <label for="startDate">出發日期</label>
            <input id="startDate" name="startDate" type="date" required />
          </div>
          <div>
            <label for="days">行程天數</label>
            <input id="days" name="days" type="number" min="1" max="30" value="7" required />
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="actions">
          <button type="submit">提交</button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>

    <footer>
      本網站會於出發前三天，自動搜尋航班、酒店、景點、交通及天氣資訊，並把結果電郵給你。
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>

